256:05b1f888de3342ac87658f06eee585eaf1a4656c648056e5bd144a438f94f7ac","download_count":1377,"created_at":"2026-10-07T03:23:39Z","updated_at":"2026-10-07T03:23:40Z"},{"id":617417871,"node_id":"RA_kwDOR_sfj84kzQyP","name":"latest.yml","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/yaml","state":"uploaded","size":350,"digest":"sha256:6376aaed51e2acdd85671d0138d81115b4783027bc5c7e9892c72f4c5ffed318","download_count":3493,"created_at":"2026-10-07T03:13:04Z","updated_at":"2026-10-07T03:13:04Z"}],"body":"## 更新重点\n\n- 新增 App 与 Studio 的鉴权 P2P 直连，直连不可用时自动回退云端中转 (#3290)\n- 改善多网卡和 Docker 环境的 P2P 连接，并修复代理 fake-IP DNS 导致的直连失败 (#3292、#3303)\n- 统一模型上下文、推理强度和计费信息识别，改进自定义接口及带前缀模型 ID 的匹配，并优先使用手动设置的价格 (#3298、#3300)\n- 修复 App 自定义接口的上下文查询，并为共享会话补充模型别名与推理选项 (#3299)\n- 修复刷新或重启后丢失漫画主题选择的问题，加载时恢复已保存的主题风格 (#3302)\n- Studio 与桌面端版本同步更新为 `0.7.31`，前端更新日志补齐 11 种语言并保留最近三个版本 (#3305)\n\n## What's Changed\n* [codex] add authenticated direct App transport with relay fallback by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3290\n* [codex] bind P2P sockets to uplinks and publish Docker UDP ports by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3292\n* [codex] unify model metadata and pricing resolution by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3298\n* [codex] forward App context endpoints and shared reasoning metadata by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3299\n* [codex] match custom model IDs by final path segment by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3300\n* [codex] preserve selected theme style on reload by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3302\n* [codex] fix P2P STUN resolution under fake-IP DNS by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3303\n* [codex] prepare Studio 0.7.31 with localized changelog by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3305\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/compare/v0.7.30...v0.7.31","mentions_count":1}
